[[File:Bone staff detail.png|left|130px]]
The '''bone staff''' is a [[powered staff]] requiring level 50 [[Magic]] to wield. It is made by combining a [[battlestaff]] with [[Scurrius' spine]] alongside 1,000 [[chaos rune]]s, requiring a [[chisel]] and level 35 [[Crafting]] to do so; players without the required level can alternatively pay [[Historian Aldo]] 50,000 [[coins]] to create it on their behalf. The chaos runes are not consumed but are used to give the bone staff an initial 1,000 charges.

In order to use the staff's magic spell, it must be charged with [[chaos rune]]s, holding up to 20,000 charges when fully charged. Each cast requires one chaos rune, costing {{NoCoins|{{GEP|Chaos rune}}|c}}. Uncharging the staff returns all remaining runes back. Additionally, unlike other powered staves, the bone staff's built-in spell gives 35 base [[Magic]] experience on a successful hit.

As a [[rat bone weapon]], it is effective against all types of [[rat (attribute)|rats]] by adding 10 damage to the player's [[maximum hit]].{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1754468057638973449|date=5 February 2024|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/106036|archivedate=5 February 2024|quote=Looks like a static +10 in the code, from what I can see.}} The staff '''cannot be used''' against any other type of monster (including manual cast [[spell]]s); doing so will yield the game message {{Mes|You can only use this weapon against rats.}} Additionally, this weapon has no attack cooldown when attacking the [[Giant rat (Scurrius)|giant rats]] that [[Scurrius]] summons.

