==Maximum hit==
The [[Maximum Magic hit|maximum hit]] dealt by the staff is dependent on the player's current visible [[Magic]] level; the formula is as follows:

<math>\begin{align}
 \text{Max Hit} &= \lfloor \frac{\text{MagicLevel}}{3} \rfloor + 5\\
\end{align}</math>

